 *  |   +-------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
 *  |   | 30:28 | **TYPE** - message type                                      |
 *  |   |       |   - _`GUC_HXG_TYPE_REQUEST` = 0                              |
 *  |   |       |   - _`GUC_HXG_TYPE_EVENT` = 1                                |
